{
  "chapter": "production/versioning",
  "tier": "drill",
  "notes": [
    "The deployable artifact is the resolved bundle, not the prompt. Its identity is",
    "content-addressed: the fields sorted by name and joined, so two deploys producing the",
    "same bundle are the same configuration whatever the git history says.",
    "The bundle resolves once, at run start, and is carried for the whole run. A run that",
    "changed configuration mid-execution is not one experiment; it is two, spliced, and",
    "neither is interpretable.",
    "Policy is the exception. It resolves at the moment of each action, or a run that paused",
    "on Friday acts on Friday's permissions.",
    "The environment timeline is a list of states; the one in force at a time is the latest",
    "entry at or before it."
  ],
